      "id": "1462594966933440",
      "score": 5,
      "review_title": "Get Sketchy!",
      "review_description": "If im gonna be completely Honest, this game has a lot of cool details and mechanics that I don't normally see in other games which is what makes the game super unique. First the maps look super cool, Secondly, the cosmetics are cool and even animated, Thirdly, you can participate in community events to get special cosmetics, Fourth, you can customize your face to have different designs in the shop map, Fifth, you can use a spell book which I find super unique (you have to draw a shape and the buff will get added to you for a moment before having a cooldown) and lastly, there are tons of content creation opportunities that many of you smaller creators can earn. This game is really cool, so try it out!",
